<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Ramp Task Difficulty Ladder — {{ team_name }}</title>
<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}
body{margin:0 auto;max-width:52rem;padding:2rem 1.25rem;
font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
color:#1b1b1b;background:#fff}
h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6{line-height:1.25;margin:2rem 0 .6rem}
h1{font-size:1.9rem} h2{font-size:1.45rem} h3{font-size:1.15rem}
p,ul,ol,blockquote,table,pre{margin:0 0 1rem}
code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.9em;
background:#f2f2f2;padding:.1em .3em;border-radius:3px}
pre{background:#f6f6f6;padding:.9rem 1rem;border-radius:5px;overflow-x:auto}
pre code{background:none;padding:0}
blockquote{border-left:3px solid #d0d0d0;margin-left:0;padding-left:1rem;
color:#4a4a4a}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;display:block;overflow-x:auto}
th,td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:.4rem .6rem;text-align:left}
th{background:#f6f6f6}
hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin:2rem 0}
a{color:#0b57d0}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){
body{color:#e6e6e6;background:#151515}
code{background:#242424} pre{background:#1d1d1d}
th{background:#1d1d1d} th,td{border-color:#333}
blockquote{border-left-color:#3a3a3a;color:#b0b0b0} a{color:#8ab4f8}}</style></head>
<body>
<hr/>
<p>version: &quot;1.0.0&quot; owner: &quot;tech-lead:{{ owner_full_name }}&quot; last_reviewed: &quot;YYYY-MM-DD&quot; ramp_window_days: 10 review_cadence: &quot;quarterly&quot; rung_label_prefix: &quot;ramp/rung-&quot;</p>
<hr/>
<h1>Ramp Task Difficulty Ladder — {{ team_name }}</h1>
<h2>Ladder (at least 4 rungs; scope, not points)</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Rung</th><th>Name</th><th>Ticket pattern (files max / modules max / flag / design review; examples)</th><th>Expected duration (min-max days)</th><th>Buddy support</th><th>Evidence (merged PR, newcomer, actual days)</th><th>Tagged tickets (&gt;= 2, label, critical path, deadline in window)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>read-only change that ships</td><td>1 / 1 / no / no; docs typo fix, dependency bump, log line</td><td>0.25-1</td><td>full_pairing</td><td>&lt;PR url&gt;, &lt;newcomer&gt;, &lt;days&gt;</td><td>&lt;ticket&gt; ramp/rung-1 no no; &lt;ticket&gt; ramp/rung-1 no no</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>single-file change</td><td>1 / 1 / no / no; rename a function and its call sites</td><td>1-2</td><td>pair_on_pr</td><td>&lt;PR url&gt;, &lt;newcomer&gt;, &lt;days&gt;</td><td>&lt;ticket&gt; ramp/rung-2 no no; &lt;ticket&gt; ramp/rung-2 no no</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>single-module change behind a flag</td><td>5 / 1 / yes / no; new endpoint behind a flag</td><td>2-3</td><td>review_on_pr</td><td>&lt;PR url&gt;, &lt;newcomer&gt;, &lt;days&gt;</td><td>&lt;ticket&gt; ramp/rung-3 ...; &lt;ticket&gt; ramp/rung-3 ...</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>cross-module change with design review</td><td>12 / 2 / yes / yes; small refactor across 2 modules</td><td>3-5</td><td>review_on_design</td><td>&lt;PR url&gt;, &lt;newcomer&gt;, &lt;days&gt;</td><td>&lt;ticket&gt; ramp/rung-4 ...; &lt;ticket&gt; ramp/rung-4 ...</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>end-to-end feature slice</td><td>25 / 3 / yes / yes; small feature API to storage</td><td>5-10</td><td>scheduled_check_ins</td><td>not_applicable: unvalidated</td><td>&lt;ticket&gt; ramp/rung-5 ...; &lt;ticket&gt; ramp/rung-5 ...</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Ramps (one block per newcomer)</h2>
<ul><li>newcomer: &lt;handle&gt;; start_date: YYYY-MM-DD; tickets_tagged_on: YYYY-MM-DD (before the start date)</li><li>progression: rung 1 &lt;ticket&gt; merged YYYY-MM-DD &lt;days&gt;; rung 2 ...; (a ticket past 2x its band: reclassified_to_rung N)</li><li>time_to_first_pr_days: &lt;n&gt;; rung_reached_on_last_day: &lt;n&gt;</li></ul>
<h2>Outcome review</h2>
<ul><li>Last run: {{ iso_date }}</li><li>Next due: {{ next_review_date }} (within the review cadence)</li><li>Ramps reviewed: &lt;n&gt;; median time to first PR: &lt;days&gt; (tolerance: 3 working days)</li><li>Per rung: rung, median actual days, within band, consecutive out-of-band cycles, action (none | rebanded | pattern_rewritten)</li><li>Version bumped: yes | no (yes whenever any rung was rebanded or rewritten)</li></ul>
</body></html>
